## 👥 ROLES (DO NOT MODIFY)

Roles (highest → lowest):

1. admin
2. manager
3. advisor
4. telecaller
5. processing

Rules:

- Do NOT rename roles
- Do NOT add roles
- Do NOT change hierarchy values
- Do NOT assume role power — always check helpers

---

## 📋 LEAD MANAGEMENT RULES

- Lead creation & bulk upload:
  - Admin, Manager only
- Lead deletion:
  - Admin only
- Lead editing & viewing:
  - Admin & Manager → all leads
  - Others → assigned leads only

Any new lead feature MUST:

- Accept `role` and `isAssignedToUser`
- Use existing permission helpers
- Never bypass access checks

---

## 🔁 LEAD ASSIGNMENT RULES

- Assignment MUST follow `ASSIGNABLE_ROLES`
- Never allow cross-role assignment outside defined mapping
- All roles may reassign their OWN leads
- Admin/Manager control global assignment

✅ Only bulk uploaded leads can auto-assign
❌ Never silently reassign
✅ Always validate via `canAssignToRole`

---

## 🔄 STATUS TRANSITION RULES (CRITICAL)

- Status transitions MUST strictly follow `STATUS_TRANSITIONS`
- UI and backend must BOTH enforce transitions

Rules:

- Use `canTransitionToStatus` before updating status
- Use `getAllowedStatusTransitions` to render UI options

❌ No inferred transitions
❌ No automatic forward/backward movement
❌ No role-based assumptions

---

## 📞 ACTIVITY & COMMUNICATION RULES

Activity types include:

- calls
- whatsapp
- notes
- reminders
- documents
- **email** ✅ (NEW)

Rules:

- Admin & Manager → full access
- Other roles → assigned leads only
- Any new activity must follow same permission structure

---

## 🔗 ACTIVITY SHARING RULES (UPDATED)

- Activity sharing MUST be prompted during lead assignment
- Applies to ALL roles
- Supported shareable activities:

  - calls
  - whatsapp
  - notes
  - reminders
  - documents
  - **email**

- Default sharing behavior must respect
  `DEFAULT_SHARING_PREFERENCES`

❌ Never auto-share without prompt
❌ Never exclude email from sharing logic

---

## 📄 DOCUMENT RULES

- Upload:
  - Assigned user OR admin/manager
- Verify:
  - admin, manager, processing
- Delete:
  - admin, manager only

Document permissions MUST NOT be relaxed.

---

## 📤 EXPORT RULES

- Export leads:
  - All roles
- Export reports:
  - admin, manager only

Export logic MUST still respect data visibility rules.

---

## 👤 USER MANAGEMENT RULES

- View users:
  - admin, manager
- Create / Edit / Delete / Role change / Deactivate:
  - admin only

Managers MUST NOT gain edit or role-changing power.

---

## 📊 DASHBOARD & ANALYTICS RULES

- Full analytics & team metrics:
  - admin, manager
- Personal metrics:
  - all roles

Never expose team or global metrics to lower roles.

---

## ⚙️ SETTINGS RULES

- Access settings:
  - admin only
- Modify settings:
  - admin only

Settings access must be blocked in both UI and backend.

---

## 🧭 NAVIGATION RULES

- Navigation visibility MUST follow `NAVIGATION_PERMISSIONS`
- Hidden routes MUST still be protected server-side

❌ Never rely on frontend-only protection

---

## 🧪 SAFE CHANGE GUARANTEES

Allowed:

- Refactoring without behavior change
- Adding NEW helpers without removing old ones

Forbidden:

- Removing exports
- Changing function signatures
- Changing return types
- Changing role behavior without explicit instruction

If behavior change is REQUIRED:
➡️ STOP and ASK.

---

## 🤖 CURSOR / AI BEHAVIOR RULES

- Be conservative
- Preserve business intent
- Never “simplify” permission logic
- Never optimize by removing checks
- Never assume missing rules

This CRM permission system is BUSINESS-CRITICAL.

Stability > Performance  
Correctness > Cleverness

